results.description:
Paytrack is a corporate travel, expenses and payment solution that connects high-end technology with specialized support.

Our solution enables all your travel and expenses processes to be safe and simple: from booking through payment reconciliation. A complete, automated and agile solution to your company.

Paytrack allows thousands of companies and professionals to focus on their goals without worrying about manual and repetitive activities. Save time and money with an all-in-one platform.

On a single platform, we blend resources and modules that were previously only available if multiple solutions were combined:

• OBT (Online Booking Tool);
• Travel Management Company (TMC);
• Direct connection with travel providers;
• Prepaid Corporate Card;
• Traditional Corporate Card;
• Payment solutions;
• Expense and reimbursement management system (Expense Report);
• KM Management by GPS.
